# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent. The terminal fan-out applies on a tree
# before that tree recorded the decision locally, breaking invariant I1: a
# cross-tree saga's terminal lands on one shard while another shard of the
# same tree resolves the saga against a snapshot with no local decision.
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentTerminalBeforeMark
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a terminal is broadcast to a tree before that tree's local decision is recorded
PERTURBS: Broadcast

--- FIND
Broadcast(t, sh) ==
    /\ sh \in Writes(t)
    /\ prep[t][sh]
    /\ term[t][sh] = "none"
    /\ loc[t][TreeOf[sh]] # "none"
    /\ term' = [term EXCEPT ![t][sh] = IF loc[t][TreeOf[sh]] = "committed" THEN "commit" ELSE "abort"]
--- REPLACE
Broadcast(t, sh) ==
    /\ sh \in Writes(t)
    /\ prep[t][sh]
    /\ term[t][sh] = "none"
    \* MUTATION: the coordinator's decision is enough.
    /\ dec[t] # "inflight"
    /\ term' = [term EXCEPT ![t][sh] = IF dec[t] = "committed" THEN "commit" ELSE "abort"]
--- END
